#: .\__translations\__translations.py:6
msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete your Speedy Net account? This is permanent "
"and irreversible. Deleting your Speedy Net account will also delete your "
"Speedy Match account. If you are sure, type \"Yes. Delete my account.\" in "
"this field, exactly and case sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Ar tikrai norite ištrinti savo Speedy Net paskyrą? Tai yra nuolatinis ir "
"negrįžtamas veiksmas. Ištrynus Speedy Net paskyrą taip pat bus ištrinta jūsų"
" Speedy Match paskyra. Jei esate tikri, įveskite šiame lauke tiksliai, "
"laikydamiesi raidžių dydžio, tekstą „Yes. Delete my account.“."

